<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EmCare Holdings started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EmCare Holdings started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer started coverage of EmCare Holdings Inc as a buy, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/4 to 26.</p>
